{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2025-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1759881600, "end_date": 1760572799, "month_true_total": 394, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:55:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "206819336", "author": {"steamid": "76561199595319444", "personaname": "skullclamp721", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199595319444/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 16585, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5470, "last_played": 1783049498, "avatar": "3ee699e03a4fdbc90a16718a36ba5e24a3f64d59"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's official I'm hooked. If you are the rare breed of gamer that has friends this is the perfect game to beg them to get. Just when you think the game is over WHAM! you unlock about another two hours of content. Excellent game!", "timestamp_created": 1760572025, "timestamp_updated": 1760572025, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206815944", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056991187", "personaname": "Greyzote", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Redtide23/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 776, "deck_playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1761475392, "avatar": "da30241def33fad6261a7996dbd3aa5609faf44e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Many guns. Little xp.\n\nThe horseheads are not fun", "timestamp_created": 1760567580, "timestamp_updated": 1760640228, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206782301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088316365", "personaname": "Trump is on the Epstein List", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198088316365/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 2378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1629, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1015, "last_played": 1785293096, "avatar": "4662a47275c022a76ec07507ff777c31f531e64e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Updating my review: idk man this game is just fun. It's the best parts of borderlands distilled. the dlc characters are rewarding and more complex than the base characters, but far from essential. huge variety of guns. talent trees open up a ton of playstyles even within one character. I could go on.\n\nIf I had any feedback for the devs, in order of priority: more maps/routes, a new boss or 2, and better tooltips/tutorials for new character mechanics.", "timestamp_created": 1760535341, "timestamp_updated": 1775070278, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206778019", "author": {"steamid": "76561198322570799", "personaname": "Wata", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198322570799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2001, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1383, "last_played": 1789053263, "avatar": "aace45f1b77b9add9991de0e69ebb75f1bb7ab7e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes", "timestamp_created": 1760530686, "timestamp_updated": 1760530686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540069699287414551", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 10, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "206742288", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043388291", "personaname": "Snowy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snowytotodile/", "num_games_owned": 235, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 18911, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 244, "playtime_at_review": 9750, "last_played": 1790233887, "avatar": "dce8b4bab5ad130defddce95e00ea11cef49b2f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is super replayable, and the devs are still updating it, which is super neat. That said, this does have some Roguelike/Roguelite elements, and it definitely both giveths and takeths away.\n\nEven on the highest difficulty of the game, you can certainly find yourself stomping the game effortlessly, destroying every boss within seconds before they even have a chance to attack. This is awesome, and the fact most games don't let you break them like this is such a shame.\n\nOf course, it's also equally as possible for you to get completely destroyed in the first section of the game by the various low-level beetles, bombers, and crossbowmen because your weapons and scrolls were trash. Hey, you can't always have a free lunch.\n\nAnyway, play this game!", "timestamp_created": 1760477746, "timestamp_updated": 1760561479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}